\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{Reproduction does not compact the completion}
\date{2026-11-07}

\p{\ref{fdip-00EI} obtains the completion and the resistance
form from the exact trace, through
\citet{Theorem 3.13}{kigami2010resistance}. The theorem uses
no measure and names no operator on square-integrable
functions. Compactness of the completion is a separate
conclusion.}
